    "htmlContent": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"tr\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>7. Sınıf 2. Ünite Özeti</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Kalam:wght@400;700&family=Nunito:wght@400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #111827;\n            color: #1f2937;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .chalk-font {\n            font-family: 'Kalam', cursive;\n        }\n        .blackboard {\n            background-color: #2f3e46;\n            border: 12px solid #5c4033;\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n            color: #f1f5f9;\n        }\n        .chalk-text {\n            color: #f1f5f9;\n            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n        }\n        .highlight-yellow { color: #facc15; }\n        .highlight-green { color: #86efac; }\n        .highlight-pink { color: #f9a8d4; }\n        .highlight-blue { color: #93c5fd; }\n\n        /* Custom Scrollbar */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 12px; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #1f2937; border-radius: 6px; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #4b5563; border-radius: 6px; border: 2px solid #1f2937; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #6b7280; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"h-screen flex flex-col p-4\">\n\n    <!-- Control Bar -->\n    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-4 bg-gray-800 p-3 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-gray-700\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-white text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold ml-4 chalk-font\">\n            <span class=\"text-green-400\">2. ÜNİTE:</span> Kur'an-ı Kerim'i Güzel Okuma\n        </h1>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n            <button onclick=\"changeFontSize(-1)\" class=\"bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-lg font-bold transition shadow border border-gray-600\" title=\"Yazıyı Küçült\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i>\n            </button>\n            <button onclick=\"changeFontSize(1)\" class=\"bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-lg font-bold transition shadow border border-gray-600\" title=\"Yazıyı Büyüt\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i>\n            </button>\n            <button onclick=\"toggleFullScreen()\" class=\"bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-lg text-lg font-bold transition shadow border border-green-700\" title=\"Tam Ekran\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-expand\"></i> Tam Ekran\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- MAIN BOARD AREA -->\n    <div class=\"flex-grow w-full h-full relative overflow-hidden\">\n        \n        <div class=\"blackboard h-full w-full rounded-xl p-8 overflow-y-auto\">\n            \n            <!-- Header Decor -->\n            <div class=\"text-center mb-8 border-b-2 border-gray-500 pb-4\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-music text-green-400 text-3xl mx-2 opacity-80\"></i>\n                <span class=\"text-4xl chalk-font highlight-yellow\">Tecvit Kuralları ve Sureler</span>\n                <i class=\"fas fa-book-open text-green-400 text-3xl mx-2 opacity-80\"></i>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12\">\n                <!-- Sol: Tecvit Kuralları -->\n                <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                    <!-- Medler -->\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl chalk-font highlight-green mb-4 border-b border-gray-600 inline-block\"><i class=\"fas fa-wave-square\"></i> Med (Uzatma) Çeşitleri</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"text-xl space-y-4 chalk-text\">\n                            <li class=\"bg-gray-700 bg-opacity-30 p-3 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-blue-400\">\n                                <strong class=\"highlight-blue text-2xl\">Meddiarız:</strong> \n                                Durulduğunda oluşan uzatmadır. (Örn: Yalemûûn). <span class=\"float-right text-yellow-300 font-bold\">4 Elif</span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"bg-gray-700 bg-opacity-30 p-3 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-purple-400\">\n                                <strong class=\"highlight-pink text-2xl\">Meddilazım:</strong> \n                                Cezim veya şedde ile oluşur. Hep uzatılır. <span class=\"float-right text-yellow-300 font-bold\">4 Elif (Vacip)</span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"bg-gray-700 bg-opacity-30 p-3 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-green-400\">\n                                <strong class=\"highlight-green text-2xl\">Meddilin:</strong> \n                                Yumuşak uzatmadır. Lin harfleri (Cezimli Vav ve Ya). <span class=\"float-right text-yellow-300 font-bold\">2-3 Elif</span>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Sakin Nun -->\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl chalk-font highlight-green mb-4 border-b border-gray-600 inline-block mt-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-microphone-alt\"></i> Sakin Nun ve Tenvin</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"text-xl space-y-4 chalk-text\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"highlight-pink font-bold w-24 text-2xl\">İHFA:</span> <span>(Gizlemek) Nun sesi genizden okunur.</span></li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"highlight-pink font-bold w-24 text-2xl\">İZHAR:</span> <span>(Açıklamak) Nun sesi açıkça okunur. (Boğaz harfleriyle)</span></li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"highlight-pink font-bold w-24 text-2xl\">İKLAP:</span> <span>(Çevirmek) Nun sesi 'Mim'e dönüşür. (Sadece 'Be' harfinde)</span></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Sağ: Sureler -->\n                <div class=\"border-l-2 border-gray-500 pl-8\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl chalk-font highlight-yellow mb-6 border-b border-gray-600 inline-block\"><i class=\"fas fa-quran\"></i> Surelerin Mesajları</h3>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-gray-700 bg-opacity-30 p-4 rounded-xl relative group hover:bg-opacity-50 transition\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-2 right-2 text-3xl opacity-20\"><i class=\"fas fa-elephant\"></i></div>\n                            <strong class=\"highlight-green block text-2xl mb-1\">Fil Suresi:</strong>\n                            <p class=\"text-xl chalk-text\">Kabe'yi yıkmaya gelen Ebrehe ordusunun Ebabil kuşlarıyla yok edilişini anlatır. \"Zorbalar kaybeder.\"</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"bg-gray-700 bg-opacity-30 p-4 rounded-xl relative group hover:bg-opacity-50 transition\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-2 right-2 text-3xl opacity-20\"><i class=\"fas fa-hand-holding-heart\"></i></div>\n                            <strong class=\"highlight-green block text-2xl mb-1\">Maun Suresi:</strong>\n                            <p class=\"text-xl chalk-text\">Yetimi itip kakan, gösteriş için namaz kılan ve yardıma engel olanları uyarır. \"Din samimiyettir.\"</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"bg-gray-700 bg-opacity-30 p-4 rounded-xl relative group hover:bg-opacity-50 transition\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-2 right-2 text-3xl opacity-20\"><i class=\"fas fa-route\"></i></div>\n                            <strong class=\"highlight-green block text-2xl mb-1\">Kureyş Suresi:</strong>\n                            <p class=\"text-xl chalk-text\">Kureyş kabilesine verilen güven ve rızık nimetlerini hatırlatır. \"Nimetlere şükret, kulluk et.\"</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"bg-gray-700 bg-opacity-30 p-4 rounded-xl relative group hover:bg-opacity-50 transition\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-2 right-2 text-3xl opacity-20\"><i class=\"fas fa-hand-paper\"></i></div>\n                            <strong class=\"highlight-green block text-2xl mb-1\">Kâfirun Suresi:</strong>\n                            <p class=\"text-xl chalk-text\">Şirki ve putperestliği kesin dille reddeder. \"Sizin dininiz size, benim dinim banadır.\"</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        let currentFontSize = 16; \n\n        function changeFontSize(amount) {\n            currentFontSize += amount;\n            if (currentFontSize < 12) currentFontSize = 12;\n            if (currentFontSize > 24) currentFontSize = 24;\n            document.documentElement.style.fontSize = currentFontSize + 'px';\n        }\n\n        function toggleFullScreen() {\n            if (!document.fullscreenElement) {\n                document.documentElement.requestFullscreen();\n            } else {\n                if (document.exitFullscreen) {\n                    document.exitFullscreen();\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
